Package: kingdee-eas-client
Version: @VERSION@
Section: office
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxi6, libxrender1, libxtst6, libfreetype6, fontconfig
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Maintainer: Local EAS Client Packager
Homepage: https://www.kingdee.com/
Description: Kingdee EAS Cloud 8.8 client with local font fixes
 Bundled Kingdee EAS Cloud 8.8 Linux client and its Oracle Java 8 runtime.
 The launcher creates a writable per-user runtime copy so online updates, caches
 and connection settings continue to work without modifying system files.
